A collaboration event between [[The Battle Cats]] and the LINE Sticker brand known as '''Betakkuma''' was held from July 27th, 2018 to August 10th, 2018. The collaboration includes exclusive stages going on during the collab period.

==Event Information==
Time to pop, lock, and groove with {{Color|#FF0000|'''Bettakuma'''}}, dropping in from LINE Stickers for a special crossover event in The Battle Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On between July 27th (11:00am) and August 10th, 2018 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Collab events in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Take on Bettakuma as a fearsome enemy in limited edition stages! Can you take down the funky army of this weirdo dancing bear or will you get swept away by the furious rhythm?<br>
Visit Legend Stories and check out the {{Color|#335599|'''Groove Like a Bear'''}} map under the Collab Stages tab, only during this event!<br>
Clear all stages in this map to earn a one-time bonus of {{Color|#FF0000|'''30 Cat Food'''}}!<br>
Only during this event, clear these limited stages and get a chance to pick up [[Betakkuma (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Betakkuma'''}}]] as a drop reward!<br>
Get better chances to pick up these drop rewards by clearing later stages in the map! Or use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance to collect the prize!<br>
<small><small>※ After collecting Betakkuma, you can visit the Cat Base's Upgrade menu and activate it at the Rare Cats section!<br>
※If this event does not appear in your Battle Cats app, ensure that you have updated the software to the most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Login Rewards Every Day!'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this crossover event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign to pick up every stamp and get a Rare Ticket, battle items and other rewards! Don't forget to login or you'll miss out!

Visit the link below to check out the Betakkuma LINE Sticket sets:<br>
https://store.line.me/search/en?q=betakkuma

